      "comments": [
        {
          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Cache the raw completion instead of parsed output**\n\nWhen a structured completion populates the cache, `finalized` includes the parser-specific `parsed` value and is stored under the same prompt/model/provider/metadata key used by ordinary completions. A later call without a structured parser therefore receives the stale `parsed` field because `finalizeCompletion()` spreads the cached response and only replaces that field when another parser is supplied; parser results can also make an otherwise cacheable response unserializable. Cache the raw provider response or explicitly omit `parsed` from cached values.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
          "author": "chatgpt-codex-connector",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-15T10:59:54Z",
          "outdated": false,
          "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/179#discussion_r4014822737",
